  "_comment": "Single source of truth for provider capability claims on the website. Every entry must be traceable to source_refs in this repository. Validated against cargo metadata by scripts/validate-providers.mjs; drift fails CI. credential_sources lists the default chain slots in real chain order (verified against each service's DefaultCredentialProviderBuilder); explicit_sources lists providers that exist but are never part of the default chain.",
